## Ticket evidence

Track the [parser issue](https://github.com/NickMcGinnis/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/1)
and [booking-v3 hint issue](https://github.com/NickMcGinnis/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/2)
separately.

The repository's `tickets/parser.md` and `tickets/hint.md` contain the issue text.
`evidence/analysis.json` records every report ID assigned to each cause and the intake-tag
cross-check. Run `npm ci` and `npm run render` to rebuild the evidence and all KB pages
from the supplied code and data. The rendered pages are in `rendered/kb/`.

